type: software
version: "1.1.0"
title: "Fed-PDE: solution-space heterogeneity in federated PDE learning"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/NUDTPingLuo/Fed-PDE"
url: "https://github.com/NUDTPingLuo/Fed-PDE"
abstract: >-
  Solution-space PDE-Dirichlet benchmarks, bin-conditioned federated gradient
  correction (SB-CFO), numerical operator datasets, recorded seed-level results,
  and reproducible analysis for seven controlled and public simulation tasks.
